    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Welcome to Sky Fields</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Sky Fields as a drone and grow your collection of Goobers while venturing across an array of floating islands. Journey through unique environments filled with various Goober genus, battling, and collecting resources  to incubate and hatch new Goobers. Each Goober type has a distinct appearance, strength, and rarity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The altitude of each island determines the Goobers you encounter and transforms the landscape itself, shaping the trees, fauna, and overall environment. This adds strategic depth to every battle, making each discovery an exciting and unpredictable experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Features:</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glide into the world of <strong>Sky Fields</strong> and soar through distinct islands and biomes. But beware\u2014the <strong>Tyrant Army</strong> lurks in the barren lands! Can you rise against them? Explore fortified sanctuaries, conquer perilous isles, and gather valuable resources on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325480/extras/81fbf203d01316b009fad86129af8129.poster.avif?t=1745926882\" width=615 height=183 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325480/extras/81fbf203d01316b009fad86129af8129.webm?t=1745926882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle &amp; Level Up</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically order your attacks in a turn-based battle. Try out different team combinations and make use of synergies between your Goobers. Position your supports and casters behind your melees to create your ideal formation. Encounter formidable foes and empower your team by levelling up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325480/extras/dfb8c1e70e7954dcdf2d6ffbee708910.poster.avif?t=1745926882\" width=615 height=183 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325480/extras/dfb8c1e70e7954dcdf2d6ffbee708910.webm?t=1745926882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your Goober!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuse your creatures to pass down abilities, stats, and even their unique appearance. With a deep breeding system offering endless possibilities, you can craft the ultimate Goober squad!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325480/extras/dbad35b1e0af2b8431ad0cdd5153fe88.poster.avif?t=1745926882\" width=615 height=183 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325480/extras/dbad35b1e0af2b8431ad0cdd5153fe88.webm?t=1745926882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Merchant</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye out for the travelling merchant, who appears periodically. Exchange your resources for gold and use it to purchase packs, with a chance to unlock an ultra-rare Goober.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325480/extras/7f51ac22060e310191683c2e358a7c98.poster.avif?t=1745926882\" width=615 height=183 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325480/extras/7f51ac22060e310191683c2e358a7c98.webm?t=1745926882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Welcome to Sky Fields</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Sky Fields as a drone and grow your collection of Goobers while venturing across an array of floating islands. Journey through unique environments filled with various Goober genus, battling, and collecting resources  to incubate and hatch new Goobers. Each Goober type has a distinct appearance, strength, and rarity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The altitude of each island determines the Goobers you encounter and transforms the landscape itself, shaping the trees, fauna, and overall environment. This adds strategic depth to every battle, making each discovery an exciting and unpredictable experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Features:</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glide into the world of <strong>Sky Fields</strong> and soar through distinct islands and biomes. But beware\u2014the <strong>Tyrant Army</strong> lurks in the barren lands! Can you rise against them? Explore fortified sanctuaries, conquer perilous isles, and gather valuable resources on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325480/extras/81fbf203d01316b009fad86129af8129.poster.avif?t=1745926882\" width=615 height=183 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325480/extras/81fbf203d01316b009fad86129af8129.webm?t=1745926882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle &amp; Level Up</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically order your attacks in a turn-based battle. Try out different team combinations and make use of synergies between your Goobers. Position your supports and casters behind your melees to create your ideal formation. Encounter formidable foes and empower your team by levelling up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325480/extras/dfb8c1e70e7954dcdf2d6ffbee708910.poster.avif?t=1745926882\" width=615 height=183 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325480/extras/dfb8c1e70e7954dcdf2d6ffbee708910.webm?t=1745926882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your Goober!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuse your creatures to pass down abilities, stats, and even their unique appearance. With a deep breeding system offering endless possibilities, you can craft the ultimate Goober squad!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325480/extras/dbad35b1e0af2b8431ad0cdd5153fe88.poster.avif?t=1745926882\" width=615 height=183 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325480/extras/dbad35b1e0af2b8431ad0cdd5153fe88.webm?t=1745926882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Merchant</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye out for the travelling merchant, who appears periodically. Exchange your resources for gold and use it to purchase packs, with a chance to unlock an ultra-rare Goober.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325480/extras/7f51ac22060e310191683c2e358a7c98.poster.avif?t=1745926882\" width=615 height=183 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325480/extras/7f51ac22060e310191683c2e358a7c98.webm?t=1745926882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
